      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "DARK"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭔가… 뭔가 도울 방법이…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "何か…何か力になれることは…",
